/P 199 0 R
/E (Designers and fashion houses are at the heart of the MWINTL runway experience. We welcome emerging and established labels seeking a distinguished environment to unveil collections, elevate recognition, strengthen market positioning, and reach broader audiences. Each participation is carefully structured to showcase the individuality of the label while providing access to runway production, professional models, casting coordination, hair and makeup, photography, videography, media exposure, promotional support, and industry connections. From haute couture and ready-to-wear to jewelry, accessories, evening wear, and specialty collections, MWINTL provides a sophisticated stage where craftsmanship, originality, and distinctive brand identity take center stage. Beyond the runway, our productions create opportunities for participating labels to build visibility, develop valuable relationships, connect with new clientele, and explore commercial possibilities within the wider marketplace. Our role is to provide the stage, production, exposure, and professional environment for each collection to make a lasting impression.)
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [4]
>>
