/E (Rather than operating through a single event model, the company develops runway presentations, exhibitions, showcases, brand activations, networking environments, and tailored experiences shaped around each production and market. Its independent structure provides the flexibility to build relationships across industries, cultures, and destinations while maintaining a distinctive identity and consistent professional standards. Through NYCFS, SFW, AFW, and international collaborations, MWINTL brings together emerging and established talent, businesses, media, sponsors, and industry professionals within environments designed to encourage visibility, meaningful connections, and growth. The result is an agile international enterprise capable of bringing together the right talent, the right audience, and the right business environment while creating experiences that celebrate cultural identity and contribute positively to the communities it reaches.)
