/E (MWINTL operates through a diversified business model built around fashion productions, commercial participation, strategic partnerships, and international market connectivity. Revenue is generated through designer participation packages, exhibitions and booth spaces, sponsorships, advertising opportunities, ticketing, media services, and selected commercial collaborations. Through NYCFS, SFW, AFW, and future international productions, the company can adapt its commercial structure according to each destination, clientele, and market opportunity.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [3]
>>
