<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 205 0 R
/E (This flexibility allows MWINTL to serve designers, brands, exhibitors, sponsors, businesses, and professional partners through different levels of participation rather than relying on a single source of revenue. The model is designed to create value on both sides of the platform: participants gain presentation, visibility, connections, and access to new markets, while MWINTL generates revenue through the professional infrastructure, services, and commercial opportunities surrounding each production.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K [4]
